    {
      "role": "SUPPORTING",
      "node": {
        "id": 149041,
        "name": {
          "full": "Saya",
          "native": "サヤ",
          "alternative": [
            "Charcoal Witch"
          ]
        },
        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b149041-LtLzGLz06SR6.png"
        },
        "description": "__Occupation:__ Witch\n\nSaya is a character introduced in the [Majo no Tabitabi](https://anilist.co/manga/98741/Wandering-Witch-The-Journey-of-Elaina/) series. She is an apprentice witch who [Elaina](https://anilist.co/character/125736/Elaina) meets in the Land of Mages as a novice.\n\nSaya has black hair tied back in a small tassel on the left side and blue eyes. She initially wears a charcoal grey outfit, black stockings, and white boots.\n\nSaya is a person with a kind personality on the outside, but is slightly manipulative in her thinking as shown when she manipulated Elaina to stay with her for a while.\n\nShe also has a desire to have company and friends, which mostly stemmed from her younger sister returning back to her homeland without her.",
        "gender": "Female",
        "age": null
      },
      "voiceActors": [
        {
          "id": 106661,
          "name": {
            "full": "Tomoyo Kurosawa",
